lines = PackedStringArray("Mind the anvil. Mind the coals. Mind your fingers, mostly.", "Forty pickaxe heads a month, every month, for a hole out east. Must be a very big hole.", "They asked me for shackles. Small ones. I told them I don't make those. They found someone who does.")

